<title>SWEDEN: Swedish airports handle 11 pct more freight Feb.</title>
<headline>Swedish airports handle 11 pct more freight Feb.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish airports handled 12,424 tonnes of freight in February, an 11 percent rise over the same month a year earlier, Sweden's civil aviation administration, Luftfartsverket, said on Friday.</p>
<p>The administration published the following figures about airport activity for the month.</p>
<p>						    Feb 1997	Feb 1996</p>
<p>SWEDISH AIRPORT ACTIVITY  Cargo (in tonnes)				12,424	  11,188</p>
<p> Mail  (in tonnes)				 2,711	   2,265</p>
<p> Passengers				    1,302,938     1,239,236</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
</text>
